## Controls
@@control at
`left`: the middle of the left edge [[c17:70]]. `center`: the middle of the map, as in the demo `c19-ending-dijkstra` [[c19:69]].

## What it produces, measured
@@measured

- **Caves, culled:** a start changes no tile, so these are the culled caves’ traits [[own]].

